EXPERIMENT 03 — HTTP-LEVEL AUTHORIZATION
Requirement: Restrict Payment Service by workload identity, HTTP method and path

$ kubectl get authorizationpolicy -n istio-part4
NAME                           ACTION   AGE
payment-allow-order-l4         ALLOW    96m
payment-allow-order-waypoint   ALLOW    3m46s
payment-default-deny-l4        ALLOW    96m

SOURCE: order-service
$ kubectl exec deployment/order-service -- python3 HTTP authorization tests

$ GET http://payment-service:8080/health
HTTP 200
{"service":"payment-service","status":"healthy"}
Expected: HTTP 200
RESULT: MATCHED

$ POST http://payment-service:8080/payments
