RESULT: MATCHED

$ GET http://payment-service:8080/payments/df812d0b-901e-4f89-a753-3ca720960069
HTTP 200
{"payment_id":"df812d0b-901e-4f89-a753-3ca720960069","amount":125.5,"status":"created","version":"v1"}
Expected: HTTP 200
RESULT: MATCHED

